      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You have carry a heavy burden, but there is no whole way to carry it alone. The pain you feel is a sign of the sacrifice you have already made for the safety of your people. I encourage you to find a quiet moment to reflect before the dawn and trust that even broken oaths can be renewed through your future actions.",
